 R←Test_InLine_027(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ns;md;expected
⍝ Test inline markup; here == <==> <mark>
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 md←⊂'This is a simple paragraph'
 ns←MarkAPL.Init''md
 ns←MarkAPL.Process ns
 expected←'<p>This is a simple paragraph</p>'
 →T.FailsIf expected≢⊃ns.html

 md←⊂'This ==was== is a simple paragraph!'
 ns←MarkAPL.Init''md
 ns←MarkAPL.Process ns
 expected←'<p>This <mark>was</mark> is a simple paragraph!</p>'
 →T.FailsIf expected≢⊃ns.html

 md←⊂'This ==was== is a simple paragraph that h==as APL in it: `(_a←2*==5)÷0.5`'
 ns←MarkAPL.Init''md
 ns←MarkAPL.Process ns
 expected←'<p>This <mark>was</mark> is a simple paragraph that h==as APL in it: <code>(_a←2*==5)÷0.5</code></p>'
 →T.FailsIf expected≢⊃ns.html

 R←T._OK
